# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages rules, read from the publish directory.
#
# A hashed asset that is missing is a real 404 (returning index.html would hand
# the browser HTML where it expects JavaScript); everything else falls back to the
# SPA shell so /doctors, /patients and page refreshes work on a static host.
/assets/*  /index.html  404
/*        /index.html  200
